From 1fa20d9a1afd643ef10c5b56c1028d652522344b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 12:32:01 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 16/18] Record 0.3.0 native release evidence

Move the 0.2.0 release evidence into evidence/release-0.2.0/, as 0.2.0
did for 0.1.0, and regenerate the capabilities, CLI request, native
sweep and independent validation evidence with the 0.3.0 release
build. The validation and sweep files are byte-identical to 0.2.0 and
the CLI result differs only in its version. Record the formatting,
Clippy and release test runs. Exclude SHA256SUMS from the crate and
sdist, since it is regenerated after packaging.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
